1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,512
Every AI data tool can make a chart.

2
00:00:03,463 --> 00:00:06,275
Almost none can defend the number.

3
00:00:06,889 --> 00:00:12,347
The analyst still cleans the export and hopes the model did not invent
a figure.

4
00:00:12,297 --> 00:00:15,643
One wrong number is enough to lose the room.

5
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:18,911
Proofsheet starts with the dirt.

6
00:00:18,861 --> 00:00:26,711
Before a model sees the file, it maps the duplicates, the mixed dates,
the currency text, and the missing values.

7
00:00:27,320 --> 00:00:29,795
You ask in plain English.

8
00:00:29,745 --> 00:00:38,729
Before any code runs, you approve the definition: which orders count,
how missing values are handled, and how discounts and dates are read.

9
00:00:49,350 --> 00:00:56,994
The report carries the approved definition, the chart, six receipted
claims, and zero unverified numbers.

10
00:00:56,945 --> 00:01:01,150
A second implementation agrees on all five metrics.

11
00:01:01,750 --> 00:01:09,355
Click any number and you get the exact code, the output, the sandbox,
and the isolation level that produced it.

12
00:01:09,949 --> 00:01:14,300
The independent implementation never sees the first script.

13
00:01:14,250 --> 00:01:20,161
It runs in its own sandbox, with the same definition and the same
parsing contract.

14
00:01:20,161 --> 00:01:22,570
Five out of five agree.

15
00:01:23,189 --> 00:01:25,612
You can try to make it lie.

16
00:01:25,562 --> 00:01:29,182
Inject a fake claim and the stamp disappears.

17
00:01:29,182 --> 00:01:31,917
The real report is untouched.

18
00:01:34,819 --> 00:01:39,925
Every task runs in a fresh sandbox with no network and no secrets.

19
00:01:39,875 --> 00:01:45,383
The drill absorbs a destructive command, a fork storm, and a
credential scan.

20
00:01:45,383 --> 00:01:48,039
The host canary survives.

21
00:01:48,659 --> 00:01:53,504
Next month, the saved pipeline replays with no model in the loop.

22
00:01:53,454 --> 00:01:59,236
Same rows, revenue up three percent, and the change is computed from
two ledgers.

23
00:01:59,839 --> 00:02:03,265
Audit-ready reporting for the Monday export.

24
00:02:03,215 --> 00:02:04,947
Proofsheet.

25
00:02:04,947 --> 00:02:08,619
The live app and repository are in the submission.

